'''Piers''' (Japanese: '''ネズ''' ''Nezu'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=You can use this card only if you have {{TCGP|Obstagoon|Galarian Obstagoon}} in play.
Discard 2 random Energy from your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

